              "calendarHubCapability": "UNCHANGED_UNLESS_EXPLICITLY_REMOVED",
              "agentCoordination": "Counter is canonical; device typing only wakes/routes the correct agent.",
              "finance": "Ledger owns finance data behind a separate protected boundary; Copilot receives scoped finance context.",
              "device": "API/Hub first, then deeplink/intent, Accessibility+IME only as verified last-mile actuation.",
              "resilience": "Cloud does heavy work; mobile remains recoverable with verified build provenance and rollback/legacy path.",
